# Notes and folders: create a folder at the root, a note inside it, and rename it.
Output assets/readme/feature-notes.gif
Source assets/readme/tapes/lib/common.tape

# the cursor starts on a root note, so the folder is created at the root
Type "G"
Sleep 800ms
Type "F"
Sleep 600ms
Ctrl+U
Type "travel"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "c"
Sleep 600ms
Ctrl+U
Type "Trip planning"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s

Type "r"
Sleep 600ms
Ctrl+U
Type "Packing list"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "q"
